  "notes": "## 0.11.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-21\n\n### Features\n\n- Add custom relay node settings with a built-in test action for users who run their own relay (#674)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent rare crashes during network activity and allow the Linux app to keep opening when system tray support is missing or incompatible (#817)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.11.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-21\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增自定义中继节点设置，并提供内置测试操作，方便使用自建中继的用户确认配置可用 (#674)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复网络活动中偶发崩溃的问题，并让 Linux 版在系统托盘支持缺失或不兼容时仍可继续打开 (#817)",
